{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10041","headline":"江南弄 · 芮挺章","name":"江南弄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春江可怜事，最在美人家。\n鹦鹉能言鸟，芙蓉巧笑花。\n地衔金作埒，水抱玉爲沙。\n薄晚青丝骑，长鞭赴狭斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"芮挺章","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10041.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10041","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}